<title>PORTUGAL: Portugal's Petrogal lifts Q1 pre-tax profit.</title>
<headline>Portugal's Petrogal lifts Q1 pre-tax profit.</headline>
<dateline>LISBON 1997-05-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Petrogal-Petroleos de Portugal, the state-controlled energy company, boosted pre-tax profit in the first quarter to 2.1 billion escudos against its budget target of 1.5 billion, chairman Manuel Ferreira de Oliveira said on Wednesday.</p>
<p>He said in a presentation to the Lisbon bourse that the profit figure was before taking into account exchange rate factors and fluctuations in energy prices, which could have had a negative impact.</p>
<p>--Fernanda Pargana, Lisbon bureau 3511-3113126</p>
</text>
